    website: "https://abundanceds.com"
keywords:
  - EuroQol
  - EQ-5D
  - health-related quality of life
  - research portfolio
  - knowledge graph
abstract: >-
  Typed evidence extracted from the full texts of 797 publications linked to
  1,024 EuroQol-funded projects under ontology 0.13: studies, populations,
  instruments, methods, findings, limitations, research products, resolved
  people, accepted project-publication links, and a dated citation snapshot.
